WEBVTT

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.040
It's morning, Cocoa.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.630
Please wake up, Cocoa.

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:26.790
You're going to get a taste of CQC
unless you hurry out of bed, Big Sister.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Bring it on...!

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:31.790
Oh really?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.790
Well, don't mind if I do!

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.330
Huh?! Rize?!

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:43.290
What is Rize doing in our house again...?

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:44.880
She's totally forgotten.

00:00:45.170 --> 00:00:48.750
I told you yesterday, I got into a fight
with my dad and ran away from home.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:50.290
Oh right, I remember now.

00:00:50.290 --> 00:00:53.540
You came by so late we turned 
it into a sleepover, yeah?

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.580
You didn't tell us all the details.
What caused the fight with your dad?

00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:02.210
Teach...

00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:03.500
"Teach"?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.210
I told him that I wanted to be an elementary
school teacher and he laughed at me.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.170
An elementary school...

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.830
...teacher?

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:15.960
Let's go, kids!

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.080
Miss Rize!

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.250
Miss Rize!

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:21.080
It's time to kick off towards tomorrow!

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:29.750
Oh, come on! Not you guys, too!

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:38.040
Spin around with a twirl, hey, dance dance

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:41.080
In the heavenly cafeteria, dance dance

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:43.630
Where is the door? (Over here!)

00:01:43.630 --> 00:01:47.170
Take a hop into the cup (Leap right in!)

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:50.750
Big puffy clouds float through the sky

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:53.880
They actually taste sweet, 
for real (Just kidding!)

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.920
If we fly through the sky 
in tea cups and coffee cups

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:59.920
We can go anywhere together

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:06.630
Wanting to be a dreamer forever 
(More impossible than possible)

00:02:06.630 --> 00:02:12.290
Think about how exciting tomorrow 
will be (So many flavors to try!)

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:14.880
Cinnamon instead of sugar

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:18.920
If that becomes a preference, 
it might be time for evolution

00:02:18.920 --> 00:02:22.170
Going to a new place (Were you invited?)

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:24.920
If you get invited there, 
let's take the plunge and fly

00:02:24.920 --> 00:02:28.130
(C'mon ride in the tea cup 
and soar through the sky)

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:30.420
(C'mon ride in the coffee cup, yeah yeah)

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:34.250
Spin around with a twirl, hey, 
dance dance (Dance dance!)

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:37.460
In the heavenly cafeteria, 
dance dance (Dance dance)

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:40.960
Where is the door? It's inside of the cup

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:43.500
An illusion? Or reality? Which?

00:02:43.710 --> 00:02:46.710
It doesn't really matter 
either way (Good point)

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:49.960
A dollop of whip cream on 
your head (Fluff fluff)

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:55.920
Okay, just dance (The future) it'll 
definitely be fun (So let's fly!)

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:59.420
Flying through the sky in 
tea cups and coffee cups

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:02.170
We can go anywhere together!

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:13.580
Sorry, Rize. We weren't 
laughing because it was funny!

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.460
I think that's a wonderful dream to have!

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.790
I guess I really might 
not be teacher material.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:25.170
My life is over once I start getting called
the "sergeant sensei from Hell."

00:03:25.330 --> 00:03:28.000
Actually, a nickname like that
might mean they idolize you.

00:03:28.630 --> 00:03:32.670
Let me handle this! I'll be your tutor!

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:38.460
I'll give you special lessons,
so that you can become a great teacher!

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:40.420
Special lessons?

00:03:41.830 --> 00:03:45.170
First, we relax and do some photosynthesis.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.500
You're making this sound 
more like a science class.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.880
The best way to earn any student's trust...

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.710
...is through their stomach!

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.750
Kids are pretty messy most of the time...

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.790
...so I need to train to be resilient!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:07.130
And then... a midday nap!

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:08.500
Midday nap!

00:04:08.500 --> 00:04:10.170
Midday nap!

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:12.460
Hey! Wait a darn second!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:15.080
You just want to laze around all day!

00:04:16.040 --> 00:04:18.210
You're more of a spoiled 
brat than a teacher, Cocoa!

00:04:18.330 --> 00:04:22.790
I'll never give up the position of "big sister."
But you can take the "teacher" title if you want.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.750
So basically... you got tired of it.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:30.580
Good grief. Cocoa makes a terrible teacher.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:33.540
Allow me to step up to the plate.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.380
You sound pretty motivated.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:37.330
Okay, Rize.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.580
Please show your teacher
how you would solve this problem.

00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:42.830
You're sounding more like 
a student than a teacher...

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:45.290
Pick me, teach! I can do it!

00:04:45.290 --> 00:04:46.710
Wow, that was fast.

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.830
Gimme a gold star or something!

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:49.380
Here.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.420
What is it?

00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.880
Wow! What a cute reward!

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:58.920
I was only doing it as a joke, 
but I guess you like it, huh?

00:04:58.920 --> 00:04:59.630
Yeah!

00:04:59.630 --> 00:05:01.080
You're such a child.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.960
You're more childish than 
an elementary schooler.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.580
I'm sensing some jealousy...

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:08.830
I did it.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:11.040
Great! Nice work!

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:13.040
Here.

00:05:13.630 --> 00:05:15.630
We match, Chino!

00:05:15.630 --> 00:05:16.710
I finished the next one.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:17.380
That was fast!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.000
Amazing!

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.250
Okay, hold out your hand.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:22.540
Here.

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.500
Not bad, Chino...

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:30.330
I did another one.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.170
You still want more?!

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:33.880
Your greed for stamps is out of control!

00:05:36.250 --> 00:05:38.460
Time to eat!

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:46.630
Rize's special napolitan 
pasta is just so buono!

00:05:46.920 --> 00:05:49.670
Do that to your own cheek.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:52.420
You two should eat your salad, too.

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:53.580
Right!

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:54.670
Celery...

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.630
Guess what? Everybody
who cleans their plate gets a desert!

00:05:58.630 --> 00:05:59.710
Desert?!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:01.170
Flan!

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.750
Or I could make it flan a 
la mode with fruit on top.

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:06.290
Flan a la mode...

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.130
Ah, that's a mood!

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:13.250
Okay, teach! I'll eat a whole bowl of salad,
so give me two helpings of flan!

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:15.580
Hey! That's not fair, Cocoa!

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.920
I'll eat a bowl, too!

00:06:17.250 --> 00:06:19.210
One serving per student.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.790
You really pampered us all day today, Rize.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.630
Well, I am crashing at Rabbit House.
Though, that's also true for you, Cocoa.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.130
Next time, let us pamper you instead!

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.130
Pamper me?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:42.210
Well, let's see. I would really enjoy having
another home-cooked meal with everyone.

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:43.920
With everyone?

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.080
Most of the time I just eat all by myself.

00:06:48.750 --> 00:06:52.000
I'm envious that your dinner 
time is always so lively.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:56.330
You can stay with us as 
long as you want, Rize.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:57.250
Huh?

00:06:57.540 --> 00:06:59.790
You can just commute to school from here!

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:04.420
Then we can eat your homemade
napolitan pasta all the time!

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:08.040
I could even work part-time during bar hours!

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:10.000
Another dream to add to the list!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:11.380
That's true...

00:07:12.710 --> 00:07:13.580
What's wrong?

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.210
My stamps... they're fading!

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.250
I didn't realize you liked them that much...

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.420
Gone! They're gone!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.210
Calm down! I'll give you more later!

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:30.040
Here! I made you two a stamp card.

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.540
Thank you.

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:35.330
Now our special bonds will never disappear!

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:36.750
You make it sound so dramatic...

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:40.250
This will be a way to commemorate
your coming to stay with us.

00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:45.460
And actually, I feel like I've gotten better
at studying thanks to your tutoring, Rize!

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.830
You're totally suited to being a teacher!

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:50.710
Y-you think so?

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:54.000
But why pick elementary school specifically?

00:07:54.750 --> 00:07:59.290
The reason I was inspired to teach elementary
was because of my interactions with the Chimame Corps.

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:02.830
Well, sergeants and teachers 
are pretty similar!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:08.460
Wait, that means... she sees us
as elementary schoolers...

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:13.460
So, how do we earn more 
stamps aside from studying?

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.330
Good question.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:19.250
You earn them by making
other people happy... just kidding!

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:22.330
That means you deserve a whole bunch!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:23.210
Why?!

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.130
Please brace yourself!

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.080
But I haven't done anything!

00:08:33.330 --> 00:08:37.040
Hey, Cocoa. How did this morning's quiz go?

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.960
I had Rize tutor me, so I think I aced it!

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:44.170
I guess the promise of a reward
is really effective in getting me motivated!

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.290
What are you talking about?

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.670
Ta-dah!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:52.290
She made this for me! Isn't it awesome?

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:56.290
Oh! I have one of those from Rize, too!

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:57.250
It's exactly the same?!

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.750
Mame both have their own, too.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:02.420
Just how many people has she given them to?!

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.380
Fine then, I hope she's ready
for the students to overthrow the teacher!

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.960
Let's dominate the academic landscape!

00:09:12.830 --> 00:09:14.130
Good afternoon!

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.630
Welcome in, Megu.

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:18.630
All by yourself today?

00:09:18.830 --> 00:09:24.130
Yeah. Cocoa told me she was holding
a cram school at Rabbit House.

00:09:24.630 --> 00:09:25.420
Cram school?!

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:26.460
I've been waiting for you.

00:09:30.210 --> 00:09:32.750
I'm Cocoa, your science professor.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.580
Let's begin our secret experiment!

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.130
Science professor?!

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.880
Yes!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:42.580
But your method of teaching
is always so hard to understand.

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:43.880
What?!

00:09:44.380 --> 00:09:47.420
And we already have
the perfect person to be the teacher.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:50.500
I thought Rize might be busy
preparing for entrance exams.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.130
I can still make the time...

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.210
Come now, Rize.

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:57.750
Don't get pouty just because 
you lost a student.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:09:59.170
I'm not pouty.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:00.670
Don't get jealous.

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.000
I'm not jealous!

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.540
Your grip says otherwise!

00:10:04.540 --> 00:10:06.750
Is this a feud between teachers?!

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:12.420
Does learning from me motivate you
to apply for my high school?

00:10:12.580 --> 00:10:15.540
Nope, I'm going to the same school as Rize.

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:17.210
Right.

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:20.080
It's the same school that my mom went to.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:24.250
But is that really what you want, Megu?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:26.080
It is.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:26.920
Are you sure?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.250
Get to teaching already.

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:33.250
It's time for the field trip.

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:35.000
You should come too, Chino.

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:35.920
Huh?

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:41.420
I am Miss Chiya, your Japanese teacher.
Let's get to work.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:44.130
AMA USA AN

00:10:42.040 --> 00:10:44.040
This is just Ama Usa An...

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:45.580
To answer this question,

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:50.830
you need to consider the protagonist's feelings
based on the scene, description and point of view.

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:51.540
Okay!

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:58.920
You look incredibly focused, Chino.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:03.000
I want to maintain a proper balance
between studying and working.

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:05.920
You and the others are so amazing at it.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:07.710
So I want to do my best, too.

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:09.460
Chino!

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:14.500
New question! Analyze and explain
how your teacher feels in this moment!

00:11:14.960 --> 00:11:15.710
Huh?

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:18.080
I know! The answer is "happy"!

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.460
That's correct!

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.080
Cut it out, you two...

00:11:24.630 --> 00:11:25.830
We're just joking.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.420
The student at the cram school next door
is working very hard.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.790
So we need to put in more effort, too!

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:31.750
Next door?

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:34.540
Shall we go take a peek?

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:41.710
She's studying right now, 
so keep quiet, okay?

00:11:42.080 --> 00:11:43.380
Maya?!

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:46.500
Quit spying on me!

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.250
Aw, what's the big deal?

00:11:49.460 --> 00:11:51.540
Let's study together!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:55.630
There's nothing to be shy about.

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.330
I only came to get some advice because
I have to take the exam for scholarship students!

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:04.540
Syaro! Don't just stand there, back me up!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:07.920
I'm really only helping her a little bit.

00:12:08.250 --> 00:12:10.920
I agreed to watch her study
since she wants to pass the scholarship exam,

00:12:10.920 --> 00:12:13.920
but doesn't have enough confidence to-

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:15.830
Never mind! Just shut up!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:21.670
We should have studied together
as a group to begin with.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:25.210
But being together like this
makes us want to chat instead.

00:12:25.630 --> 00:12:26.710
That's true.

00:12:27.330 --> 00:12:30.500
Well, all study and no play is a total drag!

00:12:30.580 --> 00:12:32.210
Time for a break.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:33.880
Hold it!

00:12:33.880 --> 00:12:35.330
No loafing around like that!

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.500
It makes you look uncivilized!

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:40.000
That hardly sounds convincing
when you're dressed like that, Syaro.

00:12:40.460 --> 00:12:43.210
But wearing this motivates 
me more when I'm at home.

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:45.750
C'mon, let's have some fun!

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:50.330
We should stay focused today,
since we have tutors helping us.

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:53.750
That's right, Maya. Don't 
waste time or else...

00:12:54.630 --> 00:12:59.250
Chimame Corps,
Report to the heated pool immediately
after you've finished your studies!

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:57.210
...you'll end up getting 
a pep talk from Rize!

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:58.750
How does she know when she's not here?!

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:03.830
I think your daughter would become a better teacher
if she stayed at our place, frankly.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:07.170
Takahiro! You gotta help 
me convince my little girl.

00:13:07.170 --> 00:13:08.710
You're good at negotiation, aren't you?

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:13.830
Rushing in without any care for
the consequences has always been your forte, no?

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:21.170
Does it look like Megu has put on weight?

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:24.670
Yeah. Particularly around the chest area.

00:13:27.130 --> 00:13:28.000
Chimame Corps!

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:29.460
Yes, sir!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.330
You need stamina if you want 
to survive cram school!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.830
Yes, sir!

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:36.790
A tired brain need only one thing: sugar!

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.290
Yes, sir!

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:42.330
And so, I've baked you all some sweets.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:46.880
I... I'll hold off...

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:49.380
Wait, you don't like cookies?

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:54.330
No, but Maya and Chino told me
that I'm going to turn into a pig if I eat too much.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.040
We did not!

00:13:56.750 --> 00:13:59.500
But earlier, you said that I put on weight.

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:01.380
Listen, Megu.

00:14:02.460 --> 00:14:04.960
Those two are just jealous of your growth.

00:14:05.380 --> 00:14:06.920
They're such kids, I swear.

00:14:07.790 --> 00:14:09.880
I hate to admit it, but she's right!

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:14.380
Chino, let's play chess!

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.710
You've taken an interest in chess?

00:14:16.880 --> 00:14:20.960
Yeah! I wanna go toe-to-toe with the chess club
when I get to high school!

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:23.380
Well, I'm going to practice swimming today.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:27.540
Because I've started to think
that swimming might be kind of fun.

00:14:27.710 --> 00:14:28.830
Oh?

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:32.420
Then let's have a race to see who can get
to the other side first!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:33.130
What?

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.540
You two really are incredible.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:37.420
Huh?

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:44.170
C'mon, girls! Hurry and get in position!

00:14:44.170 --> 00:14:46.830
Ready? Go!

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:49.080
Wait a second!

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:52.670
It's okay to take it easy!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:54.630
Go at your own pace, Megu.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:14:59.250
Megu!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.630
You're gonna be all right, Megu.

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:13.130
It doesn't seem like she swallowed any water.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:16.960
Are you okay, Megu?

00:15:18.170 --> 00:15:20.130
Why did your push yourself like that?

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:25.830
I was afraid that Maya and Chino...
would just get further and further away...

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:27.880
Megu...

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:32.630
You both decided which school
to apply to all on your own.

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:35.750
And you both took on new challenges.

00:15:36.380 --> 00:15:39.710
I panicked and rushed to catch up,
so I didn't get left behind.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:41.750
Megu...

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:47.000
But, you know, I want to discover
a new side of myself when I get to high school.

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:51.670
I'll do my best to catch up someday soon,
so you two just wait for me.

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:56.500
There's no reason for you to rush.

00:15:57.130 --> 00:16:00.380
If you ask me, all three of you
are making big strides towards adulthood.

00:16:00.670 --> 00:16:02.670
And that's because you
surround yourselves with good friends.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.130
And a great teacher, too!

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:05.830
Huh?

00:16:06.710 --> 00:16:09.290
We love you, Miss Rize!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:26.040
Hey, do you remember the other time
we all went to the pool like this?

00:16:26.670 --> 00:16:28.580
It was about a year ago.

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.460
You guys really didn't like being
called the "Chimame Corps" back then.

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:37.540
And we raced all the way to Rabbit House.

00:16:37.540 --> 00:16:38.710
Wanna do it again?

00:16:38.710 --> 00:16:39.500
Sure!

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:42.040
And if we win this time...

00:16:42.880 --> 00:16:45.290
we'll be the Chimame Corps forever!

00:16:44.630 --> 00:16:46.170
Hey! Wait up!

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.460
Jeez, you really have taken 
a liking to that name!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.670
I'm back!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:57.920
What is the meaning of this, Rize?!

00:16:57.920 --> 00:16:59.130
What do you mean?

00:16:59.460 --> 00:17:04.710
Ditching us and sneaking away to the heated pool to
enjoy yourself with the Chimame Corps. How's that fair?

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:08.460
Literally everyone has one of your stamp cards.
Care to explain that?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:09.960
You're the worst, Senpai.

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.960
You're gonna have to come with us.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.750
Let's hash this out in the kitchen.

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:19.710
H-honestly, you've got the wrong idea...

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:24.210
Just messing with you!

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:28.170
We're throwing a big home-cooked 
dinner party tonight!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.170
Yay!

00:17:30.960 --> 00:17:33.330
We all worked our butts 
off just for you, Senpai!

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.960
We put everything we had 
into making our best dishes.

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:39.000
Meat n' potatoes, fried 
chicken, hamburg steak!

00:17:39.000 --> 00:17:40.420
And of course, stir-fried bean sprouts!

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:45.920
All of this for me...?

00:17:46.170 --> 00:17:50.210
It's our thanks to you for always training with us
in our times of need.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:53.040
We know how hard you work for us, Senpai.

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:56.170
Thank you, Miss Rize!

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:03.670
I'm giving you all so many stamps!

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:07.750
Oy vey...

00:18:33.830 --> 00:18:34.880
Senpai!

00:18:34.880 --> 00:18:36.540
Do you want any help with washing the dish-?

00:18:42.210 --> 00:18:43.790
She looks so cute when she's asleep.

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.750
I bet she's tired after 
what happened at the pool.

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:50.540
She jumped in and saved me
when I was on the verge of drowning.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.380
Wow! That's Rize for you.

00:18:53.960 --> 00:18:56.170
She's always there to save us.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:59.000
She was a huge help when we went camping.

00:18:59.670 --> 00:19:05.250
She helped me train for my solo at the music recital,
and also for the school sports tournament.

00:19:06.130 --> 00:19:07.790
Thanks for everything you do.

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:10.380
Rize, our teacher.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:17.330
The word "teacher" makes her wake up!

00:19:18.710 --> 00:19:21.670
Don't give me that! "Big 
Sister" does the same for you!

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.000
Rize, your father is here to get you.

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:59.380
Say, are you hungry at all?

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.790
There's a delicious restaurant around here...

00:20:01.790 --> 00:20:02.750
I already ate.

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:07.710
Oh, that's right! You were having a party.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.210
I already had a small bite 
of food myself. No worries.

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:13.210
Good for you.

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:21.210
Alrighty then! This seems like a good time for me
to share one of my many classic battlefield jokes-!

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:21.960
Please no.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:23.630
Okay.

00:20:41.960 --> 00:20:47.790
I thought you were still a child, so to hear that you
have a dream as valiant as becoming a teacher...

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:51.080
it made me really happy.

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:55.960
But you laughed at me.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:57.540
W-well, about that...

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:00.670
I was just trying... to cover up my tears...

00:21:04.630 --> 00:21:09.420
I ended up hurting your feelings
because of my stupid pride.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:21.330
And? What do you say at a time like this?

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:25.540
You were the one who 
taught me that, you know.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.130
I'm sorry.

00:21:37.170 --> 00:21:39.210
Nicely done. Here.

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:40.960
Wh-what's this?!

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:42.380
What did you just do?!

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:44.830
S-seriously, what was it? Tell me.

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:44.830
Golly, what could it be?

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:46.250
What's on my forehead?! Come on!

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:50.500
What? Huh? Eh?

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:55.870
Bunnisode 8: 
Stamp, Sleep, Study, Smile

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.130
We are friends forever!

00:21:58.290 --> 00:22:00.380
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:22:00.380 --> 00:22:03.750
We'll make it happen! There's 
no problem since it's all okay!

00:22:03.750 --> 00:22:07.580
"There are mysterious things in this world"

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:11.420
An inviting message from 
outside the familiar window

00:22:11.540 --> 00:22:15.290
Would you like to explore different places?

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:19.000
Yeah, yeah, an adventure is 
needed every now and then

00:22:19.420 --> 00:22:23.130
And eventually on some street corner far away

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:27.130
We'll get a craving to drink the usual coffee

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:33.170
There are many things to realize 
if you just take a step back!

00:22:35.250 --> 00:22:36.830
Of course...

00:22:36.830 --> 00:22:40.580
Right now being together is 
best, together forever is best

00:22:40.580 --> 00:22:44.380
Even amidst the changing seasons

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:48.330
I want to keep these feelings, 
I want to treasure everyone

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:52.290
I'm glad to have a place that I love

00:22:52.460 --> 00:22:56.170
Right now being together is best, 
that's right, together is best

00:22:56.170 --> 00:22:59.790
Even if you go somewhere 
else, be sure to come back

00:22:59.790 --> 00:23:03.920
I think that feeling is understood

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:07.420
Because, after all, I got 
to see everyone today

00:23:07.670 --> 00:23:13.630
Seeing them whenever I want 
means... we're friends!

00:23:15.710 --> 00:23:17.460
We are friends forever!

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:19.210
Friends! Okay! Friends!

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:23.330
We'll make it happen! There's 
no problem since it's okay!

00:23:26.670 --> 00:23:31.710
Welcome! We've prepared the perfect cocktail
for our wonderful customers this evening.

00:23:32.290 --> 00:23:34.040
How would you feel about working here?

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:35.920
Bunnisode 9: Chamomile 
with a Dash of Jealousy

00:23:34.040 --> 00:23:35.250
No, thank you!
